## 🟡 Medium — Maintainability

| # | Anti-Pattern | Location | Detail |
|---|-------------|----------|--------|
| 1 | **Poor naming** | All 10 tests | Every test is named `Xxx_Works`. Names don't describe the scenario or expected outcome. Prefer `AddProduct_StoresProduct_RetrievableByGetProduct`, `UpdatePrice_NonExistentSku_ThrowsKeyNotFoundException`, etc. |
| 2 | **Missing negative/edge-case tests** | Entire class | No test for `UpdatePrice` on a missing SKU (should throw `KeyNotFoundException`), no test for `Search` with no matches, no test for `ImportFromCsv` with malformed input, no empty-catalog tests for `GetAll`/`ExportToCsv`. |

